          "docs": "Get recent activities for a given user. This OData function has some default behaviors included to make it operate like a 'most recently used' API. The service queries for the most recent activityHistoryItems, and then pull those related activities. Activities are sorted according to the most recent lastModified on the activityHistoryItem. This means that activities without activityHistoryItems won't be included in the response. The UserActivity.ReadWrite.CreatedByApp permission will also apply "
